/dist

# MoneyKeep books (security-review-1 L10): the owner's books and their side files
# (the previous version kept on save, half-written temporary copies) are never
# committed.
*.moneykeep
*.moneykeep.tmp-*

# Keys and certificates are never committed (security-review-1 L10).
*.pfx
*.p12
*.p8
*.pem
*.key
